# What platform-api owns inside the Brawl install.
#
# Left: a path under deploy/. Right: where it lands in /opt/brawl-vps.
# Applied on every deploy, so these files cannot drift from the source here.
#
# platform-auth.js is also committed in brawl-vps itself — it is a hard import
# and the service would not boot from a bare clone without it. This copy is the
# authoritative one; `deploy.sh verify` reports when they disagree.

shared/platform-auth.js   src/platform-auth.js
shared/css/koydam.css     src/panel/css/koydam.css
shared/css/admin.css      src/panel/css/admin.css
shared/logo/logo.png      src/panel/logo/logo.png
shared/logo/logoText.png  src/panel/logo/logoText.png
